159d50?sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwiixM_Dt7vzAhVar5UCHdkPAwkQ9Rd6BAhtEAU)\n\n###When is it?###\nSaturday, October 28th 6pm\n\n###Food and beverages?###\nPlease feel free to bring your own snacks! \nHalloween inspired cocktails, beer, wine, and spirits are available for purchase at our bar.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Triton Charters | Saturday, October 28 | 6-8:30pm", "booking_notes": "###Event Details:\nBuccaneer Bay Cruise with Triton Charters!\n\nBoo! You are booked for Triton's 2.5-hour pirate adventure on the waters of San Diego Bay. Wear your best costume to join in on our costume contest while enjoying a pirate-themed dance floor 🕺, full bar with themed drinks available for purchase 🍹, treats 🍬, and maybe even a few tricks 🏴‍☠️!\n\nCostume Contest Categories:\nScariest 👻\nMost Creative 🎃\nBest Couple/Group 👯‍♀️\nBest Dressed Overall 💃🏻\n\n###Parking Directions:\nPlease click [HERE](https://www.google.com/maps/place/Shelter+Island+Dr+%26+Anchorage+Ln,+San+Diego,+CA+92106/@32.7205931,-117.2297802,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x80deaba20dd194af:0x814f40bb62025a8d!8m2!3d32.7205931!4d-117.2275915) for the map of where to park. For free parking, please park in the rear of the parking lot as there are no meters. We do not have assigned parking, so please be sure to come at least 30 minutes early. \n\n###Walking Directions:\nOnce parked cross to the other side of the street on Shelter Island Drive and the path to the docks has yellow markers on the corner. The dock path is located between Intrepid Boat Works and San Diego Marine Exchange. Once on the dock path the boat is located at the second black gate. **Check-in will be directly at the gate.** Please fill out your waivers prior to arrival and have your ID handy! \n\n![Description of image](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/mUsimS2yRfWJd6Kr1RCH)\n\nOur Charter will not wait for anyone who is late and you will not receive a refund if you do not call before the charter departure informing us that you will not be arriving.\n\n###Cruise Features\n\n- Splash through San Diego Bay and set your eyes on the greatest monuments that San Diego has to offer.\n- The Triton offers cocktails and draft beer on board, served by our amazing bartenders. \n- Your Charter includes a Coast Guard Certified Captain and Crew Members to assist you on your journey. \n- Slide is not available for ticketed charters.", "cancellation_notes": "You may cancel your tickets outside of 72 hours from the charter date to receive a full refund. If the tickets are cancelled within 72 hours from the charter date, you will incur a 20% late cancellation fee. If you show up late and miss the yacht,  you will not receive a refund for your ticket or gift certificate.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Join us for a treasure filled night aboard Triton Charters! Wear your best costume!", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/triton-charters/items/320731/images/842483/", "pk": 842483, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/qem4iQYRHWrkK52MkCsQ", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/qem4iQYRHWrkK52MkCsQ", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/triton-charters/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/triton-charters/items/320731/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/qem4iQYRHWrkK52MkCsQ", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/qem4iQYRHWrkK52MkCsQ", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/triton-charters/items/320731/images/836317/", "pk": 836317, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/7wLiTkJzSkOgqJGuEBG6", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/7wLiTkJzSkOgqJGuEBG6", "compan